# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PII-bearing pipeline artifacts.
#
# These intermediate files pair original values with their synthetic
# replacements, which makes them a re-identification key for the published
# dataset. They must never be committed. The PII pipeline deletes them
# automatically once a project completes; this file stops them being tracked in
# the meantime.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/pii_runs/
outputs/pii_logs/
Datasets/**/_checkpoints/
Datasets/**/_logs/
Datasets/**/_state/
Datasets/**/_repair/
Datasets/**/_review/

# Raw model responses from failed calls: redacted for PII run modes, but the
# other stages submit source text unredacted.
outputs/*/failed_responses/
outputs/**/failed_responses/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Local scratch
.tmp_*_render/
*.tmp
